  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "48e5d78f-41c4-438a-b4f2-3c45e2f4e184",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# Market Data Context Initialization\n\nInitializes BFexplorer assemblies and service references required to access market data context APIs, and opens namespaces used by the subsequent F# code cells.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "516fa470-2824-49bd-bc5c-3de4af54a417",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "fsharp",
      "source": "#I @\u0022E:\\Projects\\Bfexplorer\\Development\\Applications\\BeloSoft.Bfexplorer.App\\bin\\Debug\\net10.0-windows\u0022\r\n\r\n#r \u0022BeloSoft.Data.dll\u0022\r\n#r \u0022BeloSoft.Bfexplorer.Domain.dll\u0022\r\n#r \u0022BeloSoft.Bfexplorer.Service.Core.dll\u0022\r\n\r\n#r \u0022BeloSoft.Betfair.WebAPI.Selenium.dll\u0022\r\n\r\nopen System.Collections.Generic\r\n\r\nopen BeloSoft.Data\r\nopen BeloSoft.Bfexplorer.Domain\r\nopen BeloSoft.Bfexplorer.Domain.Data\r\nopen BeloSoft.Bfexplorer.Service\r\n\r\nopen BeloSoft.Betfair.WebAPI.Selenium.Models"
    },
    {
      "id": "afbe39e8-84e6-4825-b279-3a50025a3760",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# Market Selections Data Overview\n\nRetrieves the market data context for the active market in BFexplorer, requests traded prices and price history data for each market selection, then prints selection names with the available data keys.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "fdb708ac-343d-4ead-ad64-b30bf49758e4",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "fsharp",
      "source": "let result =\r\n    let iBfexplorer = (bfexplorerHost :\u003E IBfexplorerConsole).Bfexplorer\r\n    let market = iBfexplorer.ActiveMarket\r\n\r\n    iBfexplorer.GetDataContextForMarket ([| \u0022MarketSelectionsTradedPricesData\u0022; \u0022MarketSelectionsPriceHistoryData\u0022 |], market) \r\n    |\u003E Async.RunSynchronously\r\n\r\nmatch result with\r\n| DataResult.Success marketDataContext -\u003E\r\n\r\n    for selectionData in marketDataContext.SelectionsData do\r\n        printfn \u0022%s - %A\u0022 selectionData.Name selectionData.Data.Keys\r\n    \r\n    let favouriteSelectionData = \r\n        marketDataContext.SelectionsData\r\n        |\u003E List.sortBy (fun selectionData -\u003E selectionData.Selection.LastPriceTraded)\r\n        |\u003E List.head\r\n\r\n    let timePriceVolumes = favouriteSelectionData.Data.[\u0022timePriceVolumes\u0022] :?\u003E TimePriceVolume []\r\n\r\n    Variables.Set (\u0022selection\u0022, favouriteSelectionData.Selection)\r\n    Variables.Set (\u0022timePriceVolumes\u0022, timePriceVolumes)\r\n\r\n| DataResult.Failure errorMessage -\u003E printfn \u0022%s\u0022 errorMessage",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Jolly Good Fellows - seq [\u0022tradedPricesData\u0022; \u0022timePriceVolumes\u0022]\r\nSea Mirage - seq [\u0022tradedPricesData\u0022; \u0022timePriceVolumes\u0022]\r\nClaret And Blues - seq [\u0022tradedPricesData\u0022; \u0022timePriceVolumes\u0022]\r\nToo Many Spirits - seq [\u0022tradedPricesData\u0022; \u0022timePriceVolumes\u0022]\r\nMargarets Pearl - seq [\u0022tradedPricesData\u0022; \u0022timePriceVolumes\u0022]\r\nCydney Sweenie - seq [\u0022tradedPricesData\u0022; \u0022timePriceVolumes\u0022]\r\nUbettanotblink - seq [\u0022tradedPricesData\u0022; \u0022timePriceVolumes\u0022]\r\nVillage Hall - seq [\u0022tradedPricesData\u0022; \u0022timePriceVolumes\u0022]\r\n"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
